    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Powerful Utterance",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The dragon expresses their power in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Powerful Utterance again for 1d4 rounds.\n- Ardent Proclamation (occult, fire) The dragon breathes a blast of flame in a 30-foot cone that deals 12d6 fire damage (DC 30 basic Reflex save save).\n- Chastising Word (mental, occult) The dragon chides the targets strictly enough to leave the mind reeling. Each creature within a 30-foot cone must succeed at a DC 30 Will save save or become Stupefied 1 for 1 minute (or Stupefied 2 on a critical failure)."
    },
