        "linguistic",
        "mental",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect The dragon is a skilled mentor, and commands its students like a general. An ally within 60 feet of the dragon can Stride once and Strike once, in any order. If it hits, the Strike deals an additional 2d6 fire damage.\n\nEffect: Word of Advice",
